# Regression: faces re-selection must reset moveto cursor offset.
# After moveto + cut on front face, then faces >X without moveto,
# the circle must draw at the face center (not carry over the prev offset).
box 50 50 50
 | faces <Y
 | moveto 0 10 | circle 3 | cut
 | faces >X
 | circle 3 | extrude 5
